WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,340
You don't have to think so hard

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:06,740
In fact, your strength is not weak

3
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:08,540
Even compared to seeds from other schools

4
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:09,740
Don't be too disdainful

5
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:13,310
Although it may not be appropriate for me to say this

6
00:00:13,310 --> 00:00:15,910
But don’t always focus on me alone

7
00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:17,460
Look at other people

8
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,860
You will find that you are really strong

9
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:22,060
Are you trying to comfort me?

10
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:23,460
Still bragging in disguise?

11
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:24,660
Do it all first

12
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,260
I have something to announce

13
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:32,820
The specific format of this year’s admissions exam

14
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:35,420
It has just been distributed to all schools

15
00:00:35,420 --> 00:00:38,150
Now let me tell you something

16
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:40,220
This year’s exam format is

17
00:00:40,220 --> 00:00:42,460
Secret Trial

18
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:45,270
Secret Trial

19
00:00:45,270 --> 00:00:46,670
Simply put

20
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:50,440
It's just a fantasy set in a secret realm

21
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,240
When you enter the secret realm,

22
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,840
I entered a fantasy world
